{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00194","headline":"重阳日中外同欢以诗言志因示羣官 · 德宗皇帝","name":"重阳日中外同欢以诗言志因示羣官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[爽]节在重九，物华新雨余。\n清秋黄叶下，菊散金潭初。\n万实行就稔，百工欣所如。\n欢心畅遐迩，殊俗同车书。\n至化自敦睦，佳辰宜宴胥。\n锵锵间丝竹，济济罗簪裾。\n此乐匪足耽，此诚期永孚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}